WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.458
"Please, Your Majesty," said Ann.

2
00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:15.390
She bowed. "You're a wise and fair king."

3
00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:18.394
"Indeed!" said the king.

4
00:00:18.395 --> 00:00:22.860
"That wizard didn't take his turn yet," Ann went on.

5
00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:29.791
"Hmm." The king looked at the queen.

6
00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:31.607
She shook her head.

7
00:00:31.608 --> 00:00:34.719
"You must decide, King.

8
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:39.528
I'm too upset about my lost bookmark."

9
00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:43.422
At last the king shrugged.

10
00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:50.584
"Guards, release the wizard," he said.

11
00:00:50.585 --> 00:00:56.276
"B-b-but . . ." Dirk's face turned bright red.

12
00:00:56.277 --> 00:00:58.661
"Your Majesty!"

13
00:00:58.662 --> 00:01:02.998
The guards released Tom.

14
00:01:02.999 --> 00:01:07.997
Suddenly he spotted something.

15
00:01:07.998 --> 00:01:14.949
Cat was hiding behind a curtain!

16
00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:17.789
"Um . . ." Tom thought fast.

17
00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:21.183
"May I take a moment to prepare my spell?"

18
00:01:21.184 --> 00:01:25.181
"No!" snapped Dirk.

19
00:01:25.182 --> 00:01:30.712
"Yes," said the king.

20
00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:33.605
Tom dashed behind the curtain.

21
00:01:33.606 --> 00:01:37.223
"What should I do, Cat?" he whispered.

22
00:01:37.224 --> 00:01:39.489
Cat held up something.

23
00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:43.810
"I found this," she said.

24
00:01:43.811 --> 00:01:49.289
"It's the queen's royal bookmark!" Tom said.

25
00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:56.456
"Wow! She'll be so happy to see it!"

26
00:01:56.457 --> 00:02:00.718
"Time's up, Wizard!" Dirk snapped.

27
00:02:00.719 --> 00:02:05.291
Cat whispered in Tom's ear.

28
00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:13.028
Then Cat jumped into Tom's pocket.

29
00:02:13.029 --> 00:02:16.286
Tom ran back to the thrones.

30
00:02:16.287 --> 00:02:19.343
"I'm ready now!" he said.

31
00:02:19.344 --> 00:02:21.745
Tom raised his wand.

32
00:02:21.746 --> 00:02:26.127
"Lost thing of the queen," he said.

33
00:02:26.128 --> 00:02:32.115
"Be seen!" Poof!

34
00:02:32.116 --> 00:02:36.448
"It's my royal bookmark!" the queen cried.

35
00:02:36.449 --> 00:02:39.874
"What a clever spell!"

36
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:41.876
The king jumped up.

37
00:02:41.877 --> 00:02:49.058
"He is the new royal wizard!"

38
00:02:49.059 --> 00:02:56.044
Tom grinned happily.

